#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
HITL-IoT Generator v1.1
=======================

Controlled, seeded generator for the HITL-IoT benchmark: smart-home IoT flow
records plus a deterministically selected (Top-K ambiguity) oversight subset
carrying *configured oversight-profile* metadata.

IMPORTANT SCOPE STATEMENT
-------------------------
* Every value in this release is GENERATED by the rules in this file and in
  HITL-IoT_config_v1.1.json.
* No field is an observation of a real network, a real security analyst, or a
  real operational SOC. Oversight-profile decisions, confidence, latency and
  rationale are simulated benchmark variables.
* This generator does not establish traffic realism, analyst validity, or
  regulatory (e.g. EU AI Act Article 14) compliance. Those require separate
  external experiments.

Usage
-----
    python hitl_iot_generator_v1_1.py --config my.json     # custom config
    python hitl_iot_generator_v1_1.py --write-config cfg.json   # dump defaults
    python hitl_iot_generator_v1_1.py --out release_v1.1                 # canonical release
    python hitl_iot_generator_v1_1.py --out release_v1.1 --check-determinism
    # Jupyter: import hitl_iot_generator_v1_1 as g; g.main(["--out", "release_v1.1"])

Main design changes relative to v1.0 are documented in CHANGELOG_v1.1.md
(written automatically to the release directory).
"""
